  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "受邀名单里的辛惠美  (Xin Huimei on the Guest List)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Reviewing the Star Night gala lineup, Qin Xiao and the network team question why Chun Yuqiao put diva Xin Huimei on the guest list after her onstage outburst. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "淳于总，那份名单我们已经看了，很不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "但是我看受邀人里面有辛惠美。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次必须要邀请她。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛惠美的形象现代独立，在网上的热度也够。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她正好符合我们的节目需求。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我就是有点担心她的合约问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她昨天跟原野已经达成了庭外和解，准备自己付这笔违约金。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等到钱一到位，我们邀请她就没有障碍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我直说吧，其实我们担心你和她有前嫌。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我跟她没有前嫌，明天之内给你回复。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "淳于总，那份名单我们已经看了，很不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, we have reviewed that guest list, and it looks great.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "但是我看受邀人里面有辛惠美。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, I noticed Xin Huimei is among the invited guests.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次必须要邀请她。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We definitely need to invite her this time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛惠美的形象现代独立，在网上的热度也够。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei's image is modern and independent, and her online buzz is strong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她正好符合我们的节目需求。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She fits our programme's needs right on the mark.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我就是有点担心她的合约问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am just a little worried about her contract dispute.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她昨天跟原野已经达成了庭外和解，准备自己付这笔违约金。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yesterday she reached an out-of-court settlement with Yuanye and will pay the penalty herself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "等到钱一到位，我们邀请她就没有障碍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once the payment goes through, there will be no obstacle to inviting her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我直说吧，其实我们担心你和她有前嫌。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Speaking frankly, we worry there is bad blood between you and her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我跟她没有前嫌，明天之内给你回复。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hold no grudge with her, and I will give you an answer by tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "淳于总，那份名单我们已经看了，很不错。",
      "gap": 0.5
